equirements, funding routes and document planning. Separate general admission from scholarship deadlines.\",\"image\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/images/design/china/china-8-1280.webp\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-10-19\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-10-19\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass Editorial Team\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/editorial-policy/\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/logo.svg\"}},\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/jiangsu-university-admissions-scholarships/\"}"}}],["$","script","3",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is the Jiangsu admission deadline the CSC deadline?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. General admission and scholarship application schedules must be checked separately.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does the January CSCA date extend the spring deadline?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No extension is established. Ask admissions how the later score-upload requirement interacts with the earlier application closing date.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I assume a Presidential Scholarship pays every expense?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. Confirm the current award class, covered costs, duration and applicant category from the official notice.\"}}]}"}}]],"$L19",false,"$L1a","$L1b"]}]
